out TXSE</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/leadership">Leadership Team</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/governance">Governance</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/media-center">Media Center</a></div><div class="flex min-w-[120px] flex-col gap-2"><p class="type-body-2 !mb-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-foreground">Connect</p><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/contact">Let’s Connect</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/contact?dept=press">Press Inquiries</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/careers">Careers</a></div><div class="flex min-w-[120px] flex-col gap-2"><p class="type-body-2 !mb-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-foreground">Quick Links</p><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/trading">Trading Center</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/listings">Listing Center</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/regulations">Regulation Center</a></div><div class="flex min-w-[120px] flex-col gap-2"><p class="type-body-2 !mb-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-foreground">Legal &amp; Compliance</p><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a><a class="type-body-3 whitespace-nowrap text-accent no-underline transition-[color,font-weight] hover:font-medium hover:text-foreground" href="/regulations/rules-filings">Rule Filings</a></div></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-full h-0.5 shrink-0 mt-12" style="background:linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--color-light-leather-500) 30%, var(--color-light-leather-500) 70%, transparent)"></span><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 desktop:flex-row desktop:items-start desktop:justify-between desktop:gap-16"><div class="flex max-w-[405px] shrink-0 flex-col gap-2"><p class="type-body-3 !mb-0 text-midnight-sky-100">Texas Stock Exchange</p><div class="type-description-2 text-midnight-sky-100">TXSE Group Inc is the parent company of the Texas Stock Exchange LLC.<br>The Texas Stock Exchange (TXSE) is a fully integrated, electronic, national securities exchange built and headquartered in Dallas. Backed by some of the largest financial institutions and liquidity providers in the world, TXSE will focus on enabling U.S. and global companies to access U.S. equity capital markets. It is on track to provide a venue to list and trade public companies and the growing universe of exchange-traded products in 2026. TXSE is a wholly owned subsidiary of TXSE Group Inc.</div></div><aside aria-label="Citations" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2"><p class="type-body-3 !mb-0 text-midnight-sky-100">Citations</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1 tablet:flex-row tablet:gap-x-8"><ul class="flex flex-1 flex-col !m-0 !p-0"><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">1</span><span><a href="https://twitter.com/GovAbbott/status/1707518975570055463" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-midnight-sky-100 no-underline transition-colors hover:text-accent">Governor Greg Abbott</a>, 2023</span></li><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">2</span><span>TXSE analysis of Bureau of Economic Analysis data, through Q1 2024</span></li><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">3</span><span>TXSE analysis of Bureau of Economic Analysis data, through Q1 2023</span></li><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">4</span><span>TXSE analysis, 2024</span></li></ul><ul class="flex flex-1 flex-col !m-0 !p-0"><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">5</span><span>Legislative Reference Library of Texas, 1968</span></li><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">6</span><span><a href="https://businessintexas.com/business-sectors/major-employers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-midnight-sky-100 no-underline transition-colors hover:text-accent">Texas Economic Development Corporation</a>, 2023</span></li><li class="flex gap-1.5 type-description-1 text-midnight-sky-100"><span class="shrink-0 text-accent">7</span><span><a href="https://businessintexas.com/why-texas/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-midnight-sky-100 no-underline transition-colors hover:text-accent">Texas Economic Development Corporation</a>, 2024</span></li></ul></div></aside></div><p class="type-description-1 !mb-0 mt-10 whitespace-pre-line text-midnight-sky-100">Copyright © 2026. 
